@startuml c03-design-classes
title Zaměřený návrhový třídní diagram: Confirm / Approve (C03 H2)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class "reservations.api" as API <<module, Reservation API>> {
  + confirm_reservation(reservation_id, x_user_id) : ReservationOut
  + approve_reservation(reservation_id, x_user_id) : ReservationOut
}

class ReservationService <<Reservation Management>> {
  + confirm(user_id, reservation_id) : Reservation  «@serialized»
  + approve(user_id, reservation_id) : Reservation  «@serialized»
  - _allocate(reservation) : Reservation
}

class AllocationPolicy <<Allocation Policy>> {
  + check(candidate, station, others) : AllocationDecision
}

class AllocationDecision <<value object>> {
  allowed : bool
  code : str
  related : tuple
}

interface ReservationRepository {
  + expire_pending(now)
  + user(user_id) : User
  + get(reservation_id) : Reservation
  + station(station_id) : ChargingStation
  + relevant_for(reservation) : list[Reservation]
  + save(reservation, expected)
}

class SqlReservationRepository <<Reservation Store>> {
  + save(reservation, expected)
  - _translate(IntegrityError, reservation) : AllocationConflict
}

interface Notifier {
  + send(to, subject, body)
}

class NotificationIntegration <<Notification Integration>> {
  + send(to, subject, body)
  - log : list  (SENT / FAILED)
}

class Reservation <<entity>> {
  id
  user_id
  station_id
  start_time
  end_time
  state : State
}

class ReservationError <<exception>> {
  code : str
  related : list
}

class AllocationConflict <<exception>>

class StaleState <<exception>>

API --> ReservationService : volá
ReservationService --> AllocationPolicy : check()
ReservationService --> ReservationRepository : expire_pending / user / get /\nstation / relevant_for / save
ReservationService --> Notifier : send() po COMMIT
ReservationService ..> Reservation : mění state
AllocationPolicy ..> AllocationDecision : vrací
ReservationRepository <|.. SqlReservationRepository
Notifier <|.. NotificationIntegration
SqlReservationRepository ..> AllocationConflict : vyhodí při porušení\nconstraintu (ADR-01)
SqlReservationRepository ..> StaleState : vyhodí, když stav\nnení expected (BR-03)
ReservationError <|-- AllocationConflict
ReservationService ..> ReservationError : vyhodí
ReservationService ..> StaleState : zachytí @serialized,\noperaci zopakuje
@enduml
